                        "entry_id": "7733c37d-0dbe-3985-909e-c61c17490880",
                        "glosses": [
                            "To be located in the house of the sign ruled by the planet. For example, when a planet is in the house Gemini, it disposits Mercury because Mercury is the ruling sign of Gemini."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "transitive"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
