                                "sense_id": "6ad4d492-03c8-3c68-b9ba-e95692e520fc",
                                "text": "Venus then indirectly disposits all planets in Leo because these planets are disposited by the Sun, ruler of Leo, and Venus disposits the Sun."
                            }
                        ]
